STANDALONE SSG TRACKS
=====================

These files are compiled by `sound/tools/ssg_compile.py` into
`sound/driver/ssg_data.inc`.

Unlike `sound/mml/*.mml`, these tracks are for the standalone SSG sequencer and
are started explicitly through:

- `playSSGTrack(track)`
- `soundSetSSGPreset(preset)`
- `playInsertCoinSSG()`

CURRENT SOURCE FILES
--------------------
  0_square_menu.mml   — clean square-wave menu loop
  1_arcade_alert.mml  — short alert pattern
  2_insert_coin.mml   — insert-coin one-shot sting
  3_warrior_riff.mml  — extra warrior riff accent line

Current preset config source:

  config.ssg          — preset bank compiled into `ssg_config.inc`

BUILDING
--------
  make ssg
  make ssgconfig
  make sound

USAGE
-----
Typical manual use:

```c
soundSetSSGPreset(1);
playSSGTrack(2);
```

Current shipped live flow note:

- the default title and game helpers now prefer direct ADPCM-B playback
- standalone SSG remains available for menu beeps, alerts, insert-coin stings,
  and explicit retro square-wave overlays
